      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>It is recommended that you enable the use of statuses in document as batches are specified according to receiving results (Administration — Warehouse and delivery — Kitting statuses).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>توصیه می‌شود استفاده از وضعیت‌ها را در سند فعال کنید، زیرا بچ‌ها بر اساس نتایج دریافت مشخص می‌شوند (مدیریت — انبار و تحویل — وضعیت‌های کیت‌سازی).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Рекомендуется включить использование статусов в документе, так как серии указываются по результатам приемки (Администрирование - Склад и доставка - Статусы сборок (разборок)).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Parti kabul sonuçlarına (Yönetim; Ambar ve teslimat; Montaj (demontaj) durumları) göre belirlendiğinden, belgedeki durumların kullanılmasının etkinleştirilmesi önerilmektedir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>It is recommended that you enable the use of statuses in document as batches are specified according to receiving results (Administration — Warehouse and delivery — Kitting statuses).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>It is recommended that you enable the use of statuses in document as batches are specified according to receiving results (Administration — Warehouse and delivery — Kitting statuses).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>It is recommended that you enable the use of statuses in document as batches are specified according to receiving results (Administration — Warehouse and delivery — Kitting statuses).</value>
